<http://www.semanticweb.org/int_r1/664c904d-4745-4a5f-a519-e7493f7c962f> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                                  :Source ;
                                                                         <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "man_-mio_0004_0002_0001_0002"@it .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/int_r1/681d5e6a-bbcc-40fc-98ef-d18b4767ac76
<http://www.semanticweb.org/int_r1/681d5e6a-bbcc-40fc-98ef-d18b4767ac76> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                                  :InterpretiveObservation ;
                                                                         <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <http://www.semanticweb.org/int_r1/619b9f46-3471-43e1-a301-c1a950521dfa> ;
