###  http://www.semanticweb.org/int_r1/69051ecd-9197-417e-9f26-a1070d174b28
<http://www.semanticweb.org/int_r1/69051ecd-9197-417e-9f26-a1070d174b28> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                                  :InterpretiveProcess ;
                                                                         :hadInterpreter <http://www.semanticweb.org/int_r1/863db4cb-2fb4-4d69-be93-3d86ed8593d3> ;
                                                                         :interpreted <http://www.semanticweb.org/int_r1/76bb6e32-d850-4422-b589-a836ba25e456> ,
                                                                                      :a8bdd863-fc65-417e-ba4f-5966d900ce12 ,
                                                                                      :b21d45b2-208a-4480-a966-4edc31ed03a2 ;
                                                                         :produced <http://www.semanticweb.org/int_r1/66310e30-0c27-4e6f-8af6-50259a651dcb> ,
                                                                                   :d76077bb-16cd-4fe6-b09a-e86f4a731a2a ;
                                                                         <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasInfluencedBy> <http://www.semanticweb.org/int_r1/8a564405-613b-4db1-8738-e5eb057f44c9> ;
                                                                         rdfs:comment "Lo studio precedente si è concentrato sulla storia costruttiva dei due edifici IRE, interpretata attraverso la lente del ruolo e della storia della società IRE, autrice di questi progetti."@it ,
                                                                                      "The previous study focused on the construction history of the two IRE buildings, interpreted through the lens of the role and history of the IRE company, the author of these projects."@en ;
                                                                         rdfs:label "Il precedente processo interpretativo dell'interprete 1"@it ,
                                                                                    "The previous interpretive process of Interpreter 1"@en .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/int_r1/7ce09639-1227-4ac9-a141-01b1c15f38f0
<http://www.semanticweb.org/int_r1/7ce09639-1227-4ac9-a141-01b1c15f38f0> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                                  :InterpretiveObservation ;
                                                                         <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <http://www.semanticweb.org/int_r1/6400d3ac-7c71-4c87-8e62-d871918c83d4> ;
                                                                         rdfs:label "Il concetto di Unificazione sembra rappresentare un quadro teorico più ampio della standardizzazione, riflettendo una visione della Ricostruzione più estesa e culturale, che investe non soltanto il mondo fisico, ma la società nel suo complesso."@it ,
                                                                                    "The concept of Unification appears to represent a broader theoretical framework than standardization, reflecting a more comprehensive vision of Reconstruction that extends beyond the physical realm to encompass society as a whole."@en .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/int_r1/76bb6e32-d850-4422-b589-a836ba25e456
<http://www.semanticweb.org/int_r1/76bb6e32-d850-4422-b589-a836ba25e456> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                                  :Source ;
                                                                         <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "man_-mio_0001_0001_0046"@it ;
