###  http://www.semanticweb.org/int_r1/9f335147-30f6-4bba-8832-7bb46b8bf8ac
<http://www.semanticweb.org/int_r1/9f335147-30f6-4bba-8832-7bb46b8bf8ac> rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                                                                  :InterpretiveSubprocess ;
